                <divLine xml:id="m-eb9db656-2019-477f-9c6c-6f10e0368c10" facs="#m-7cb0a2c0-42ba-482a-ab13-965df3c32b24" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-f3999c91-c30c-45ea-8fa6-60fdfb1b2548">
              <lg xml:id="m-38e7c784-a5c2-45cd-85f5-16c2455387b9">
                <l xml:id="m-31c14199-0418-4c3e-90d0-f8f86c424f36" facs="#m-0c4a01e8-81f2-4489-b1f4-cd208d4f05ad" label="text-like">Saturday in Ember week of September.</l><l xml:id="m-1a850473-a565-4a6a-8049-cb9e099e83ef" facs="#m-217ac0ee-68c1-496f-b3b4-54b8fea12a22" label="ambiguous">1055</l><l xml:id="m-559f4a2d-1c2f-4ac9-a63e-2e7d92139a5c" facs="#m-25b667cc-1588-4a9c-bc73-b4bbbf19bc23" label="lyrics-like">Ecce anni tres sunt ex quo vénio! Deum. Respóndens autem archi¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e291987-ecc2-4df8-8439-aa21ea0d8a86" facs="#m-89e49f8e-3476-4195-a275-8add5ee880fc" label="lyrics-like">quaerens fructum in ficúlnea hac,</l><l xml:id="m-92289036-d01b-4ec3-be40-627f430b9b4d" facs="#m-ff853c26-fd43-4fb9-9dbc-b91af46aee23" label="lyrics-like">synagógus, indígnans quia sábbato</l><l xml:id="m-0ea2adf9-f744-4c9b-8da3-8c72a9c084f0" facs="#m-70f44f47-b61d-49e4-8e09-6c73012a7bf2" label="lyrics-like">curásset Jesus, dicébat turbae: Sex</l><l xml:id="m-e0b98341-15f4-4b7f-97b6-e1afcb8fcddc" facs="#m-11f1a93f-bbf2-467b-9bea-4321d21515be" label="lyrics-like">et non invénio : succide ergo illam:</l><l xml:id="m-4640f822-0e7c-4a38-8c4d-b2b27b181b62" facs="#m-408da542-17c2-4510-83ea-d6609d561113" label="lyrics-like">ut quid étiam terram óccupat? At</l><l xml:id="m-43d27236-7a99-4e0e-8e6f-e2f8aa6039b5" facs="#m-e950a708-51f1-4a57-9969-c2d7d7e36bbe" label="lyrics-like">dies sunt, in quibus opórtet operá¬</l><l xml:id="m-984cbd62-44ce-4a6b-9a2b-a7e36c6d1226" facs="#m-832715eb-3b75-4588-a74c-86308cedafff" label="lyrics-like">iue respóndens, dicit illi : Domine,</l><l xml:id="m-cb61d1ed-659d-41c1-92cc-78961223d363" facs="#m-92c08f97-e48c-414f-a3b3-fe41a362c340" label="lyrics-like">ri: in his ergo venite, et curámini,</l><l xml:id="m-aa4823cc-3043-4e3f-9a73-fc03520faa6a" facs="#m-20a2559d-3a7b-407a-8f42-f4be34acdc44" label="ambiguous">dimitte illam et hoc anno, usque</l><l xml:id="m-87dc453d-07f7-48d8-b338-a8121199f706" facs="#m-0013be57-3df3-4b5d-ac7b-20ce4730392a" label="lyrics-like">et non in die sábbati. Respóndens</l><l xml:id="m-73f11deb-f3c9-4983-ad38-30e9024c2031" facs="#m-5450f641-948a-43e2-a5bc-3e5618ad4b56" label="lyrics-like">dum fódiam circa illam, et mittam</l><l xml:id="m-d172e2b3-92da-45fe-98e3-3fb0a1ef069e" facs="#m-27aed376-5e32-4dcf-b5d3-39049377995e" label="lyrics-like">autem ad illum Dóminus, dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-20e68eb1-72f3-445b-83e1-7850619cc18a" facs="#m-ee561a1b-e963-4672-bd49-68f1c072836e" label="lyrics-like">stércora: et si quidem fécerit fru¬</l><l xml:id="m-a568c20c-c1ad-4423-bbc4-20051f181bac" facs="#m-383282bd-5b3c-43f9-b78a-bd6724acb439" label="lyrics-like">Hypócritae, unusquísque vestrum</l><l xml:id="m-9688ae74-fb7e-4b03-a8e2-d6374d568740" facs="#m-3b4c20d4-d34c-4bef-918c-d6e867c31156" label="lyrics-like">ctum: sin autem, in futúrum succí¬</l><l xml:id="m-2cb7c987-dd6c-4c39-9ae1-8e4f5255bf6f" facs="#m-192853e8-5fac-4c2e-b060-d3a01f28e644" label="lyrics-like">sábbato non solvit bovem suum,</l><l xml:id="m-3d2a594d-1ce5-4fe5-8857-519b5e4c0123" facs="#m-e8ca1939-7762-47b3-9372-fe0d1d1bbfcb" label="ambiguous">des eam. Erat autem docens in</l><l xml:id="m-475379dd-96d0-4a3a-a64c-98c1b8017459" facs="#m-4741bfd3-fb14-4f27-bb24-80cd4d86df84" label="lyrics-like">aut ásinum a praesépio. et ducit</l><l xml:id="m-ccfd7d91-6e4d-4f7f-9697-4f018d60bfc7" facs="#m-374418b6-1476-45f2-98b8-cfa23e2280d9" label="lyrics-like">adaquáre? Hanc autem filiam Abra¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a5a8615-509a-44a8-a040-58255963ae4d" facs="#m-e096e86f-fb04-45c6-9ea3-9524a5160924" label="lyrics-like">synagóga eórum sábbatis. Et ecce</l><l xml:id="m-c85d2d86-70db-4079-90db-bdd335c4168b" facs="#m-15c9fdbe-b9a6-47a0-a447-863f9384a8d3" label="lyrics-like">hae, quam alligávit sátanas, ecce</l><l xml:id="m-cfb7dc51-640a-488a-ad3f-2e4f713be205" facs="#m-0fc14d4e-96bd-4246-b427-8b97c641a720" label="lyrics-like">múlier, quae habébat spíritum infir¬</l><l xml:id="m-d97c1991-26d9-41f2-9832-be4f60f1f1cb" facs="#m-9d9fa854-957b-4deb-9934-f017309aa63e" label="lyrics-like">mitátis annis decem et octo: et</l><l xml:id="m-ede3df17-044c-4641-9fc8-c4a8c810de7d" facs="#m-4cd7e037-29af-4fb1-b915-d53297e165bb" label="lyrics-like">decem et octo annis, non opórtuit</l><l xml:id="m-3fde154e-88b2-413a-8d04-50535ec509c8" facs="#m-e47fc162-5cdb-458f-8904-80b168c62746" label="lyrics-like">solvi a vínculo isto die sábbati?</l><l xml:id="m-af33d01f-3ee4-42e0-a25c-8d461a08926b" facs="#m-4ad71369-9f3b-462c-8870-2a71ab4225e8" label="lyrics-like">erat inclináta, nec omníno póterat</l><l xml:id="m-9e729e69-cacf-48b1-83c1-de45141dd632" facs="#m-8fc0b181-7a07-4810-9060-45f8d38b3447" label="lyrics-like">Et cum haec díceret, erubescébant</l><l xml:id="m-b1ff1152-3e34-44e5-b2b6-0f4f18840070" facs="#m-51981581-beaf-490c-bd3c-ca5f0d2887f8" label="lyrics-like">sursum respicere. Quam cum vidé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e1ab45ac-07df-4174-b49b-e2c56375423c" facs="#m-3e00a46e-884a-4559-acf7-c162d8d6faf9" label="lyrics-like">omnes adversárii ejus: et omnis pó¬</l><l xml:id="m-90e2e0b7-d502-4443-8c85-5c4e5fb7422d" facs="#m-ade6654c-4faa-4a16-9f0d-b1be7c163e5e" label="lyrics-like">ret Jesus, vocávit eãm ad se, et ait</l><l xml:id="m-db62346f-8227-4150-87c0-df223211dc08" facs="#m-202179bb-c544-477d-998e-ebe1a2467f97" label="lyrics-like">ili: Múlier, dimíssa es ab infirmi¬</l><l xml:id="m-40364703-afd2-48e7-8bad-8070c3c975c5" facs="#m-e301b0a5-9070-4631-a556-972cb6464389" label="lyrics-like">pulus gaudébat in univérsis, quae</l><l xml:id="m-f66fb17f-5c7b-457e-bd5b-0161f547b62b" facs="#m-ad37557d-3e0a-42a7-9359-2bce045aa17a" label="lyrics-like">táte tua. Et impósuit illi manus, et lglorióse fiébant ab eo¬</l><l xml:id="m-38fc9cf8-1838-448a-95fb-e13eddae9008" facs="#m-99768bb4-9183-46df-a664-84aed1e5e7ef" label="lyrics-like">conféstim erécta est, et glorificábat</l><l xml:id="m-568ecf4f-faa1-4024-88aa-c1b41c98abb2" facs="#m-e1e02572-25a6-4fe2-994c-58a57f616912" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Dómine. D. 544.</l><l xml:id="m-1b31018a-6a49-4bf0-9898-044424fbf229" facs="#m-059dbdc7-ced9-42e8-bb27-8a7a187182f6" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-1d7e7108-8883-4485-a22b-1bda84a10d3f" facs="#m-61a4d788-22d1-4801-a72f-30d200cfc9c0" label="lyrics-like">VOncéde, quaésumus omnípotens devotiónis obtineat, et efféctum</l><l xml:id="m-7c4d5b18-daad-44b2-ab14-32255803d8cb" facs="#m-a305c481-12b3-45fd-99f9-37460feba9b1" label="lyrics-like">U Deus: ut óculis tuae majestátis beátae perennitátis acquírat. Per</l><l xml:id="m-8b873ae7-afc6-4852-83d4-0ca31edbfb9d" facs="#m-4b834615-adb4-4f33-8ff5-be8437e764b1" label="lyrics-like">munus oblátum, et grátiam nobis! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3ff5af2f-9503-4e67-b752-c823486d3927" facs="#m-d51c0af8-df81-4e7f-b4d2-6a1a0f69827b" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-b98feae0-2af9-477e-8d4e-409413895398" facs="#m-d163f265-143e-424c-b6bb-712ede6265e2" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-6ed3efd7-9fed-40e2-b176-3f09bbb0fed0" facs="#m-653c7f3f-308a-443f-b2c9-dd5957e4ec76" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-b3890317-8446-467d-9bd5-2d298a9ca069" facs="#m-48d6708d-4994-4762-9fa1-a79253517197" label="lyrics-like">Ense séptimo “ fésta ce-lebrá-bi¬ tis, cum in</l><l xml:id="m-ac77801d-4fda-49a2-9b8c-c7562bc6107f" facs="#m-e2f3d191-af21-4289-b990-ce5499d1de40" label="lyrics-like">ta-bernácu-lis habi-tá-re féce-rim fí-li¬ os Isra-el,</l><l xml:id="m-9b683916-a453-4806-92ff-6cf0f696ddf1" facs="#m-66d18895-111d-46ff-a283-f0822d5cee38" label="lyrics-like">cum edúcerem é-os de térra Aegypti, égo Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-5a4964db-6cf9-4a4e-800a-4ff6ea5e8864" facs="#m-78c01191-1147-4fc0-b95c-73fa36a05d14" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us</l><l xml:id="m-716c5a88-e613-4f10-af60-7afde969afff" facs="#m-5c3c8b92-cd12-420d-af2c-87f55f1fabdd" label="lyrics-like">vé- ster.</l><l xml:id="m-b4984cd0-d967-403d-ab53-cf677d2cb706" facs="#m-ba1e1065-554f-4985-93f5-7d62f1c950fa" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-aed56606-6bbc-44f9-8bf6-5f5fd86a3c34" facs="#m-52da22d1-10ac-4ab8-b2a5-640fd0b186e7" label="lyrics-like">Erficiant in nobis, Dómine, spécie gérimus, rerum veritáte ca¬</l><l xml:id="m-b96a3ce3-7e1e-42fb-9eb7-5486e1d482e9" facs="#m-cbf08afa-05bb-4f21-b888-2b130dbb37d3" label="lyrics-like">Equaésumus, tua sacraménta piámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-a75615e8-a68f-4c45-861b-fbbde6afc0ab" facs="#m-6aaad3be-c203-41ce-a635-c6ef1f1edd04" label="lyrics-like">quod cóntinent: ut, quae nunc</l><l xml:id="m-36ab48d5-fbb8-452b-ae44-938f013c3391" facs="#m-b3e8ac65-aa62-4917-8ac6-1282ad417374" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>